{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWMODULEDESCRIPTIONTEMPLATE_SECTION_13_2_1_NvM_Service_Dependencies","src":"manifest","doc":"BSWModuleDescriptionTemplate","page":222,"text":"13.2.1 NvM Service Dependencies\nThis chapter describes the usage of the specific meta-classes derived from Service-\nNeeds within a Basic Software Module. The meta-class NvBlockNeeds is used\nto define requirements to configure the NVRAM Manager Service. There are several\nuse cases how a Basic Software Module can interact with the NVRAM Manager\nservice. Each use case is discussed in a separate sub-chapter.","caption":"13.2.1 NvM Service Dependencies","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWMODULEDESCRIPTIONTEMPLATE_SECTION_13_2_1_NvM_Service_Dependencies","releases":["4.3.1"],"page":233,"hash":"3e7ffc700e387259","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/1f2ec98d930e/page_233.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWMODULEDESCRIPTIONTEMPLATE_SECTION_13_2_1_NvM_Service_Dependencies","releases":["R20-11"],"page":225,"hash":"0d92639d5f4ab132","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/51bb8c0169fb/page_225.webp"},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_BSWMODULEDESCRIPTIONTEMPLATE_SECTION_13_2_1_NvM_Service_Dependencies","releases":["R21-11","R22-11"],"page":222,"hash":"b66dbf448055b548","caption":"","screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/d4a6e197e0d7/page_222.webp"}],"releases":["R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","4.3.1"],"screenshot_path":"_src/spec/snippets/assets/d4a6e197e0d7/page_222.webp","trel":"R21-11","tstat":"section","drop":"R23-11","kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.75,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"usage of BswServiceDependency for NVRAM Manager","rel":[],"id":"TPS_BSWMDT_04029"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.7,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"publish NVRAM service resource dependencies","rel":[],"id":"RS_BSWMD_00045"}],"ok":true,"schema":"versions-explorer@1"}